{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：17:30 2026-09-09 HKT</p>\n\n<p>王祖藍日前接受新城知訊台節目《放飯ICU》訪問，大方分享家庭溫馨趣事與夫妻相處之道。與李亞男結婚11年的他笑言，太太性格單純，即使發火也像在微笑，自己的火爆脾氣早已被對方徹底磨平。他更自爆曾因太太在上海大手筆豪花數萬元購買美甲套票而動氣，豈料李亞男一句：「你鍾意我單純吖嘛？」瞬間令他哭笑不得並舉手投降，直言：「你贏！」王祖藍亦感觸表示，當年全靠好友蔡少芬大力鼓勵才鼓起勇氣表白，否則早已錯過這段良緣，足見夫妻恩愛如初。</p>\n<h2>王祖藍大爆女兒「戀愛腦」</h2>\n<p>除了夫妻生活，王祖藍亦談及兩名女兒王天韻（Gabby）及王海靜（Hayley）。他大爆7歲大女Gabby是個不折不扣的「戀愛腦」。他笑稱大女剛與前「男友」分手，轉頭便結識了新「男友」，連雙方家長都已經相當熟絡；女兒更口是心非，嘴上說不喜歡對方，私下卻特意邀請男方出席生日派對，並表示「想佢開心」，令身為人父的他忍不住直感嘆：「完全戀愛腦！」王祖藍坦言為人父母難免會擔心，但他寄語一眾家長最重要是保持與子女的溝通渠道，切勿因小事破壞親子關係。</p>\n<img alt=\"除了夫妻生活，王祖藍亦談及兩名女兒王天韻（Gabby）及王海靜（Hayley）。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4076fd8544b7bcd145576658b0b99be9/2026-09/wong_cho_lam_260284283_1128568597915752_4315740394770675452_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍指，大女Gabby是個不折不扣的「戀愛腦」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a8988500c5d1e6c757cedcc0526cbd29/2026-09/03_4_9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍與李亞男育有兩名女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/011c6a33aa90e3e36a8e341a880b7a43/2024-02/428161421_18413467054058389_995918955313394430_n_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李亞男與王祖藍育有大女王天韻（Gabby）與細女王海靜（Hayley）。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/20371af70cd0aa7fc0327f97aa42f955/2024-02/001t6hzbly1hlnqrg4kuqj61sc2ds4qr02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李亞男為王祖藍三年抱兩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe1ca4f83c090dca281a23675301887d/2023-09/liahnam_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍一家四口定居上海，間中會返香港。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/202b84e4feca16843ad10bb389427a18/2024-02/401439749_18399940207058389_5292933759252319190_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍與李亞男每年都會為囡囡慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1f49073516db3556f916a4bf60669339/2024-02/001t6hzbly1hkeiuxgrdfj61s035shdu02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍夫婦每年都為兩女搞生日派對。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa1b455142f7ac33f7ef111d5e35349c/2024-12/WONG_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩年前，大女開生日派對，當時已邀請過「男朋友」到現場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e53ca772decff3def14343920d20ec4f/2024-12/VS--Gabby--0_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍主動上前打招呼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0277cb882b628b2cd4fce13ca72a2b0f/2024-12/VS--Gabby--0_04_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Gabby的男朋友估計是學校的同學仔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b3068470dc6e4850794f6cab19e1f12d/2024-12/VS--Gabby--0_07_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍發現自己與大女的男朋友都穿上了淺藍色的恤衫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4bb55d52382982391bd4a28976bd6c5a/2024-12/VS--Gabby--0_05_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"首次見面即撞衫，場面尷尬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2df4f5b731c72a26d1b7de5d31c5ebaf/2024-12/VS--Gabby--0_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"畫面更標示大女的男朋友是「mini版祖藍」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/497dbb4f1d1d0ef81cc4fbe483ed9ee7/2024-12/VS--Gabby--0_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Gabby的男朋友非常害羞，跟王祖藍打完招呼便轉身離開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fc5dd7c95362ea499e13251a33282c14/2024-12/VS--Gabby--0_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Gabby亦沒有再理會爸爸，跟着男朋友到旁邊玩耍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2eea244c42e5b166539018c65086cd41/2024-12/VS--Gabby--0_19_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍目擊Gabby與男朋友在波波池玩耍的甜蜜場面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/64a8610766a6959b6523748431e67fb7/2024-12/VS--Gabby--0_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍感到驚訝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/71c56af7f0e151e0b899d1f8c7c16a42/2024-12/VS--Gabby--0_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍更大爆Gabby情竇初開一面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8146826bf4afd6d912d5906cbd9981f5/2024-12/VS--Gabby--0_28_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍指Gabby為了男朋友，親自整餅乾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b4494c731053e8fc4a85b6226f553526/2024-12/VS--Gabby--0_30_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍對Gabby有此言論大感驚訝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8bcece71ec26bc6cd10ee40a0023be51/2024-12/VS--Gabby--0_32_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"如今見到Gabby的男朋友，他都有些吃醋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bee169666c6a51ffcec67e713d3f7f51/2024-12/VS--Gabby--0_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍感到心碎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b0dad09b36056f21c15c49784274e9b0/2024-12/VS--Gabby--0_36_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍大女Gabby已經升小學。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/67f7351cab0b10a4002e468252c160b5/2024-07/cad10d57-0c28-4b57-914c-55f54075ed79.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Gabby於2024年出席幼稚園畢業禮，她穿上彩虹裙，與同學一同表演。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c7fa733d52792ffe99eb670ec0cf1373/2024-07/353c0f78-2a9f-4782-b331-5f1f86a3416e.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Gabby換上畢業袍領畢業證書，結束幼稚園生涯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ca595dd6a8bdc99ab0876e852b4c1e9/2024-07/88c2c263-02ac-43f6-88a6-bf8fcf0d95c0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍夫婦不時晒出家庭照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3ff7cbda0cb0fe0ff6eafda3db6e8c47/2023-02/gabby14.jpg\"/>\n<h2>王祖藍自資製作兒童劇 新TVB旅遊節目將播出</h2>\n<p>有女萬事足的王祖藍亦將家庭生活融入事業，他以兩位女兒為靈感自資製作共52集的情緒教育兒童劇，並找來女兒擔任「首席測試員」，作品近日已於央視首播。此外，他透露下周將有全新TVB旅遊節目《藍朋友·旅朋友》推出，期間更順道帶小朋友回太太溫哥華娘家探親；年底他亦將於西九竹翠公園籌辦「藝人之家」40周年大型聖誕音樂市集活動，家庭與幕前幕後工作雙軌並行。</p>\n<h2>王祖藍豪宅極寬敞內貌逐格睇？</h2>\n<img alt=\"李亞男嫁王祖藍後，過少奶奶生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0b806b3b6d8577ea333659399990dc37/2024-12/Leanne_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍與李亞男已結婚11年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e87ee41cd29e05a44f027c7c5fbd6aae/2024-02/LAM_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍2015年曾以老婆李亞男名義購入豪宅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65c119e2e2681f774feb8d653b73f09e/2023-01/001t6hzbly1h56i8328v8j640k5mdhdw02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍花1.1億元購入白石角逸瓏灣II頂層特色戶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e0f07f629525acbbd2d14de7b18feb4/2024-02/CAP_1__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李亞男拍片公開豪宅內貌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba6799378a262d575a98df06d932d0f2/2024-02/CAP_2__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"見到有不少玩具。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/baab22fea90fc18aef575a51ced1ec94/2024-02/CAP_4__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"擺放大桃花。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a0e79b41fd6624c8a18fa54620446fd/2024-02/CAP_8__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李亞男背後望到海景。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/67c000907408aad2d2c5955717394ef9/2024-02/CAP_12__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"客廳擺滿玩具。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c0a7f9b4f73e964bf3c6ae16d3452a7d/2024-02/CAP_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"玄關位置擺放蘭花。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d9379dbf332b5dff868a20aaa4a42a1/2024-02/CAP_16__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有一盆大吉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3ebfbb00c3b62cf47ba3d8c8ceb8c26a/2024-02/CAP_17__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"門口位置擺滿鞋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ae2eaffea2f319ea918a5b881513fd7/2024-02/CAP_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"好大個雪櫃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e9da8bfe06a5989d4370698d8391916/2024-02/CAP_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廚房空間感十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37c8aee5f1e49557dbca7dea16dd5696/2024-02/CAP_30_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"工作枱好實用。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1175e9ee0aa08e2d4a5a5be7fc7dcf68/2024-02/CAP_31_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"工作枱好長。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e31a3ac113e5020501f1dae949dd7ff/2024-02/CAP_32_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍與李亞男站在廚房不狹窄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afd580407a670a04ced47fd5b06b88d3/2024-02/CAP_39__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍與李亞男屋企面積好大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8749e132ab55eecb5afbe8531c77bdea/2024-02/CAP_42_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍介紹食材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/33a048836df06dd307960ba3aed11e59/2024-02/CAP_60_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"平台望到無敵海景。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac47d91e519342c8695315e5058237f5/2024-02/CAP_65_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"平台好寬敞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27971c30b2424e309a8c8dfbc53ccedb/2024-02/CAP_66_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"平台鋪上草坡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/499318dd7a57dab16bec57a4d8868b86/2024-02/CAP_68_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"可以烤肉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eab28052cbe66b7713033b91902259fb/2024-02/CAP_70_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張枱好多功能。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af27a4414a94817bc209915c7405f4dc/2024-02/CAP_72_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"特色戶空間十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8cf31f7d821a281d8e726007e1cf4b7/2024-02/CAP_78_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小朋友有玩樂專區。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f5f9dcf05cb21b688705506a177643eb/2024-02/CAP_83_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"囡囡身後見到有種植地方。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9256e85bc7cb6e349b74ef3d76d1242b/2024-02/CAP_96_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"仲有鞦韆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e058a6f99e35af2b361071091fa66fc6/2024-02/CAP_99_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小朋友可以足不出戶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8dac82bbb6516dd59ee5e8b195e2a00f/2024-02/CAP_100_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"客、飯廳都好寬闊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d415a4968222185cd60052cda54e500c/2024-02/CAP_104_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"玄關位置。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/11a6a82bb9661c470e87bc540d71d858/2024-02/CAP_105_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"四代同堂做節。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f907c544d7f57274699257939b97b735/2024-02/CAP_108_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T09:40:57.443730+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":681,"images":59,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}